{'symbol': 'CERN', 'date': '2022-03-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'NUANCE AND CERNER WORKING TO IMPROVE CLINICIAN AND PATIENT EXPERIENCES', 'text': 'COMPANIES EXPAND THEIR EXISTING COLLABORATION TO INTEGRATE NUANCE DAX TECHNOLOGY THAT IS SIMPLER FOR CLINICIANS TO USE AND EASES CLINICAL DOCUMENTATION BURDEN ORLANDO, FLA. , MARCH 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT THE HIMSS GLOBAL HEALTH CONFERENCE & EXHIBITION, NUANCE® COMMUNICATIONS, INC. \xa0AND CERNER CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CERN) ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE EXPANDED THEIR COLLABORATION TO INTEGRATE THE NUANCE® DRAGON® AMBIENT EXPERIENCE ™ (DAX™) SYSTEM INTO THE CERNER MILLENNIUM® \xa0ELECTRONIC HEALTH RECORD (EHR).'}